नि-√ 1. कृत् P. Ā. -कृन्तति, ˚ते, to cut or hew down, cut away, cut or chop off, cut through or or to pieces, massacre, KātyŚr.; MBh.; R.; Suśr. &c.;
 Ā. ˚ते, (also) to cut one's self (or one's nails &c.), TS.; ŚBr. :
Caus. -कर्तयति, to cause to cut or cut down, ŚāṅkhŚr.

नि-√ 1. कृष् P. -कर्षति, to draw or drag down, TS.; ŚBr.;
 -कृषति, to plough in (फलं क्षेत्रेषु), AV.Paipp. :
Pass. -कृष्यते, to be borne down by the stream of a river, MBh. i, 3616.,

नि-√ क्षिप् P. -क्षिपति, to throw or cast or put or lay down, throw &c. in or upon (loc. or उपरि), Yājñ.; MBh.; R. &c.;
to pour in (क्षीरं शरावे), Pañc. iii, 135/136;
to deliver anything (acc.) to (loc., esp. हस्ते),
to give or hand over, deposit, intrust, Mn.; Yājñ.; MBh. &c.;
to instal, appoint to (loc.), R.;
to lay aside, give up, leave, abandon, cast off, repel, MBh.; R. &c.;
to put down figures, count, cipher, Lalit.
